        ===== Apache Log4j API =====

        pom.xml pins log4j2 to 2.24.3 (latest) via the log4j2.version
        property override. The following CVEs are reported against 2.24.3
        itself; no patched release exists at analysis time.

        Log4j API is a compile-only SLF4J bridge in this project.
